From: Prateek <prateekxd15@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 16:23:55 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 09/27] feat(live): fast clipping of finished 10-20 h streams
 without downloading the video

A finished stream pasted on the Live page now runs live/vod.py: audio
only (11 h in ~2.5 min), a parallel voice scan for reactions boosted by
YouTube's "most replayed" heatmap, Groq transcripts of the best ~3x
candidates only, the free LLM gateway picks the most viral moments with
hook start/end/title (signal fallback), then only those 22-45 s pieces
are downloaded in 1080p and rendered (face on top, streamer-only
captions). Same session/clip rows and page as live clipping; new
live_sessions.progress_message shows the step. Finished streams were
refused before: test updated (owner change), upcoming streams still 422.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
